    <informations>Shelly Plus 1 — mounting plate, back view.
Terminals, left to right as printed: O I SW 12V L N.
Back view: the terminal order is mirrored against the front label face.

Official sources:
https://kb.shelly.cloud/knowledge-base/shelly-plus-1
https://kb.shelly.cloud/__attachments/a_a8905ae131d68beb64923e3b9de1788f9becd14c2815a67e353db7aeb6250abd/Shelly%20Plus%201.jpg?cb=0718666a09ac8ca18f58153893a944bd
https://kb.shelly.cloud/__attachments/a_7cfa072bb2d0dc6f7486b92b170168c364d63b9cb02f103f7d9250bf37fff728/Plus-1-internal-schematics.png?cb=859b7ac75c9af8b5572057a91fe4196a
https://kb.shelly.cloud/__attachments/a_a51d0b570e1403513bc399d8027d3768cfda9d1ebdc52ce5f84bdd5ba173b0eb/Shelly%20Plus%201%20multilingual%20printed%20user%20and%20safety%20guide.pdf

Notes:
- Seven-pitch shell: pitch position2 is physically blank, six actual screws. 12V is a separate physical input.

Nominal dimensions and an illustrative outline: corner radii, screw pitch and recesses are drawn to be recognisable, not to manufacturing CAD.</informations>
